      "Do not be alarmed when your spiritual desires, your passion, and your inner promptings do not align with what is common in your biological family or social circle. God does not relate with you on the basis of your earthly lineage; He relates with you on the basis of His divine blueprint for your life. When you try to force yourself into someone else's mould, you lose your spiritual edge and become powerless. Embrace the mystery of your peculiarity. Stand firm when others misunderstand your consecration, your fasting lifestyle, or your passion for kingdom righteousness. Your difference is not a defect; it is the signature of your divine assignment."
