      "Integrity is not an obstacle to promotion; in the kingdom of God, it is the bedrock of enduring influence. Daniel had the rare ability to dissolve hard sentences, interpret dreams, and discern the handwriting of God because his vessel was untainted by Babylonian compromise. If you want heaven to back your career, your business, or your ministry, you must resolve in your heart today that you will not defile yourself. Let your character be so clean, your competence so refined, and your spirit so excellent that even your fiercest critics will be forced to glorify the God you serve. You were sent into Babylon not to be swallowed, but to stand out."
